  "Description": "This module exploits a PHP code injection vulnerability in D-Link Central WiFi Manager CWM(100) versions below `v1.03R0100_BETA6`. The vulnerability exists in the username cookie, which is passed to `eval()` without being sanitized. Dangerous functions are not disabled by default, which makes it possible to get code execution on the target.",
